# Optional production alternative: coturn (BSD-3-Clause), on an already available free host.
# Verify its current release, security advisories and host cost before installation.
# Replace the documentation address. Nothing starts automatically.
listening-ip=127.0.0.1
listening-port=3478
stun-only
no-software-attribute
no-cli
no-tls
no-dtls
no-multicast-peers
# Disable persistent logs. Check your packaging/systemd defaults for additional logging.
log-file=/dev/null
no-stdout-log
# Anonymous Binding remains a potential UDP reflector. Apply source filtering,
# packet-rate and bandwidth limits at the host firewall; do not enable TURN.
